":"https://api.github.com/users/Leeziao/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leeziao/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leeziao/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"type":"reporter"},{"user":{"login":"internetteletubbie","id":271594584,"node_id":"U_kgDOEDA0WA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/271594584?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/internetteletubbie","html_url":"https://github.com/internetteletubbie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/internetteletubbie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/internetteletubbie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/internetteletubbie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/internetteletubbie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/internetteletubbie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/internetteletubbie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/internetteletubbie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/internetteletubbie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/internetteletubbie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"type":"reporter"},{"user":{"login":"arundr0id","id":312652042,"node_id":"U_kgDOEqKxCg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/312652042?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arundr0id","html_url":"https://github.com/arundr0id","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arundr0id/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arundr0id/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arundr0id/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arundr0id/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arundr0id/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arundr0id/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arundr0id/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arundr0id/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arundr0id/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"type":"reporter"}],"comments":3,"cvss":{"vector_string":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H","score":8.1},"epss":{"percentage":0.00576,"percentile":0.47518}},{"ghsa_id":"GHSA-23wf-92cp-8pcj","cve_id":"CVE-2026-118658","url":"https://api.github.com/advisories/GHSA-23wf-92cp-8pcj","html_url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-23wf-92cp-8pcj","summary":"Echo has Arbitrary Scheme Injection in WWWRedirect/NonWWWRedirect Middlewares via X-Forwarded-Proto","description":"## Summary\n\nThe `c.Scheme()` method in Echo (`context.go:162-181`) trusts the `X-Forwarded-Proto`, `X-Forwarded-Protocol`, and `X-Url-Scheme` request headers without validating that the value is `http` or `https`. The `WWWRedirect()` and `NonWWWRedirect()` middlewares use this unsanitized scheme to construct redirect URLs, allowing an attacker to inject arbitrary URI schemes into the `Location` response header.\n\n## Affected Components\n\n- `context.go:162-181` - `Scheme()` method returns attacker-controlled value verbatim\n- `middleware/redirect.go:172-184` - `redirectWWW`/`redirectNonWWW` use unsanitized scheme\n\n## Proof of Concept\n\n```\nGET /path HTTP/1.1\nHost: example.com\nX-Forwarded-Proto: javascript\n\nResponse:\nHTTP/1.1 301 Moved Permanently\nLocation: javascript://www.example.com/path\n```\n\nConfirmed injectable schemes: `javascript`, `data`, `vbscript`, `file`, `ftp`, `ssh`, `telnet`, `gopher`.\n\nOnly `WWWRedirect()` and `NonWWWRedirect()` (and `WithConfig` variants) are affected. `HTTPSRedirect`, `HTTPSWWWRedirect`, `HTTPSNonWWWRedirect` are NOT affected (they hardcode `https://`).\n\n## Impact\n\n- Open redirect to arbitrary scheme URLs when app is not behind a proxy that strips `X-Forwarded-Proto`\n- Cache poisoning when behind a CDN that caches redirect responses keyed by path\n- `file://` scheme injection could trigger file access in some browser configurations\n\n## Suggested Fix\n\nWhitelist scheme in `c.Scheme()` to only return `http` or `https`:\n\n```go\nfunc (c *Context) Scheme() string {\n    if c.IsTLS() {\n        return \"https\"\n    }\n    if scheme := c.request.Header.Get(HeaderXForwardedProto); scheme != \"\" {\n        scheme = strings.ToLower(strings.TrimSpace(scheme))\n        if scheme == \"https\" {\n            return \"https\"\n        }\n    }\n    return \"http\"\n}\n```\n\n## Disclosure\n\nSource code review, manually verified with actual HTTP server. Tested on Echo v5.0.4 (latest master).\n\n## Patches\n\nFixed in `github.com/labstack/echo/v5` v5.1.1 and `github.com/labstack/echo/v4` v4.15.2. `Context.Scheme()` now accepts only `http`, `https`, `ws` or `wss` from the `X-Forwarded-Proto`, `X-Forwarded-Protocol` and `X-Url-Scheme` headers, and falls back to `http` for any other value (#2953).\n\n## Workarounds\n\nUpgrade to a patched version. If you cannot upgrade, have your edge proxy overwrite or remove the `X-Forwarded-Proto`, `X-Forwarded-Protocol` and `X-Url-Scheme` request headers.","type":"reviewed","severity":"medium","repository_advisory_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labstack/echo/security-advisories/GHSA-23wf-92cp-8pcj","source_code_location":"https://github.com/labstack/echo","identifiers":[{"value":"GHSA-23wf-92cp-8pcj","type":"GHSA"},{"value":"CVE-2026-118658","type":"CVE"}],"references":["https://github.com/labstack/echo/security/advisories/GHSA-23wf-92cp-8pcj","https://github.com/labstack/echo/pull/2953","https://github.com/labstack/echo/commit/ca4f38a474302aabee93c66bdd0052359882e181","https://github.com/labstack/echo/commit/d1d8ad3f99dd9b80542cd0c357d56a8916c515df","https://github.com/labstack/echo/releases/tag/v4.15.2","https://github.com/labstack/echo/releases/tag/v5.1.1","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-23wf-92cp-8pcj"],"published_at":"2026-10-28T21:04:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T12:39:21Z","github_reviewed_at":"2026-10-28T21:04:10Z","nvd_published_at":null,"withdrawn_at":null,"vulnerabilities":[{"package":{"ecosystem":"go","name":"github.com/labstack/echo/v5"},"vulnerable_version_range":"< 5.1.1","first_patched_version":"5.1.1","vulnerable_functions":[]},{"package":{"ecosystem":"go","name":"github.com/labstack/echo/v4"},"vulnerable_version_range":"< 4.15.2","first_patched_version":"4.15.2","vulnerable_functions":[]}],"cvss_severities":{"cvss_v3":{"vector_string":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:L/I:L/A:N","score":4.7},"cvss_v4":{"vector_string":null,"score":0.0}},"cwes":[{"cwe_id":"CWE-601","name":"URL Redirection to Untrusted Site ('Open Redirect')"}],"credits":[{"user":{"login":"Den-Sec","id":156823722,"node_id":"U_kgDOCVjwqg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156823722?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Den-Sec","html_url":"https://github.com/Den-Sec","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Den-Sec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Den-Sec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Den-Sec/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Den-Sec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Den-Sec/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Den-Sec/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Den-Sec/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Den-Sec/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Den-Sec/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"type":"reporter"}],"comments":2,"cvss":{"vector_string":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:L/I:L/A:N","score":4.7},"epss":{"percentage":0.00186,"percentile":0.08153}}]